Golden Rule yaad rakho:

Routes → URL define karte hain.
Middleware → Request ko verify/modify karte hain.
Controller → Request receive karta hai aur response bhejta hai.
Service → Business logic implement karta hai.
Model → Database structure define karta hai.
Database → MongoDB connection establish karta hai.
Config → External services aur app configuration rakhta hai.
Utils → Reusable helper functions.
Validator → Incoming data validate karta hai.